{title: I Lift Up My Hands}
{key: F}
{x_theme: worship, praise}
{x_source: chrd:i_lift_up_my_hands.chrd}

{comment: Verse}
[F]Father I [C/F]love You
and [Gm7(4)]my heart is filled
with [Bb2M7/C]desire  to  [C7sus]see[C/E]
Your [F]power and [C/F]glory,
[Gm7(4)]cover the earth as the
[Bb2M7/C]waters clothe [C7]the   [Dm11]sea.
[Gm9]I am surrounded by
the [Fadd2/A]fortress of God,
[Ebmaj9]totally surrendered to You.[C7sus][Db7sus][Db]

{comment: Chorus}
I lift up my [Gb]hands
standing [Ebm7]unashamed.[Db]
I [Abm7/Db]worship You [Gb]Father,[Db/F]
ex[Ebm7]alting Your [Db]name.
You've [Ddim7]captured my heart[Ebm7]
now my [Gbadd2/Bb]life has changed,[Ab7/C]
I lift up my hands,
I lift up my hands.[Bmaj9][Gbadd2/Bb][Abm9]

{comment: Other}
I [Abm9/Db]lift up my hands.[Gbadd2]
{ci: (repeat 3x)}
